        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn AZC206, Symmetry Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob made by Acorn will be at home in even the most modern-styled homes. Ultra sleek in design, this solid stainless steel pull features a unique shape to show off your individual style. The Symmetry Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull blends traditional styling with modern materials to give your kitchen a fresh appearance that is truly distinctive. Available in polished stainless steel or brushed stainless steel finishes in 5 lengths: 3\", 3-1/4\", 3-1/2\", 3-3/4\", and 4\". \r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn AZC-206 Absolute Zero Collection Symmetry Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Available in polished stainless steel or brushed stainless steel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AZC206-3:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (c.c. hole spacing): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AZC206-3.25:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (c.c. hole spacing): 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AZC206-3.5:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (c.c. hole spacing): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AZC206-3.75:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (c.c. hole spacing): 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AZC206-4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (c.c. hole spacing): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
